# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own values.
# .env is git-ignored. Never commit real keys.
# The deploy workflow reads the same names from repository secrets
# (Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions).
 
# --- Safe to ship in the app, and therefore safe to deploy -------------------
# These identify your project. Both vendors document them as safe to expose in a
# client. Your Supabase RLS policies and Firestore rules are what protect the
# data, not the secrecy of these values.
